WEBVTT

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.836
that accepts your authentic self.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:05.436
But expressing that self
isn't always straightforward.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.896
A while back, psychologists
conducted a huge meta-analysis,

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:13.346
a study of studies synthesizing data
from more than 20,000 people.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.116
It turned out that, on average,

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.946
the more people focused on
being themselves at work,

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:20.236
the less successful they were.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:22.146
For reasons we're about to explore,

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:26.306
they got lower performance reviews
and fewer promotions.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.896
Being authentic has some landmines.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:30.540
And I've developed some guidelines